#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:506
msgid "WCAG 2.2 Success Criterion 2.4.11 (Focus Not Obscured)"
msgstr "WCAG 2.2 Succeskriterium 2.4.11 (Fokus ikke tildækket)"

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:508
msgid ""
"Requires that when a user interface component receives keyboard focus, the "
"component is not entirely hidden due to author-created content (such as "
"sticky navigation bars or modal banners)."
msgstr ""
"Kræver, at når en brugergrænsefladekomponent modtager tastaturfokus, må "
"komponenten ikke være helt skjult af forfatterskabt indhold (såsom fastlåste "
"navigationslinjer eller modale bannere)."

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:512
msgid "WCAG 2.2 Success Criterion 1.4.3 &amp; 1.4.11 (Contrast Minimum)"
msgstr "WCAG 2.2 Succeskriterium 1.4.3 &amp; 1.4.11 (Kontrast minimum)"

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:514
msgid ""
"Requires at least 4.5:1 contrast for normal text and 3:1 for large text and "
"visual information required to identify user interface components and states."
msgstr ""
"Kræver mindst 4,5:1 kontrast for normal tekst og 3:1 for stor tekst samt "
"visuel information til identifikation af brugergrænsefladekomponenter og "
"tilstande."

